    <statement><p>Let <m>g(x,y) = \cos\mathopen{}\left(2x+4y\right).</m></p>
<p><alert> 1.</alert> Evaluate <m>g(1,-2).</m></p>
<p>Answer: <m>g(1,-2) =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><alert> 2.</alert> What is the range of <m>g(x,y)</m>?</p>
<p>Answer (in interval notation): <fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\cos\mathopen{}\left(2-2\cdot 4\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left[-1,1\right]</m>
      </p>
